\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0-1人'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      skills</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'技术写作'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'培训'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'社区运营'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      focus</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '文档、培训、用户支持'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scalingGuidelines</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    small_org</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      dev_teams</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '3-5 个'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      platform_team</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2-3 人（兼职产品经理）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CI/CD + 部署标准化'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    medium_org</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      dev_teams</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '10-20 个'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      platform_team</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '5-8 人（含产品经理）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '完整 IDP + 开发者门户'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    large_org</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      dev_teams</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '50+ 个'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      platform_team</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '多个子团队，10-20 人'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '平台生态系统 + 插件市场'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>大型组织中，平台团队本身也需要拆分。常见的拆分方式是按平台能力域：CI/CD 团队、基础设施团队、开发者体验团队、安全合规团队。每个子团队负责平台的一个能力域，共同形成&quot;平台的平台&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组织演进与认知负荷管理\">组织演进与认知负荷管理</h2><p>平台团队的终极目标是管理组织的认知负荷。Conway 定律告诉我们，系统设计反映组织结构。平台团队通过提供标准化的平台能力，使流对齐团队能够专注于业务领域。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"cognitive_load_types:&#10;  intrinsic:&#10;    definition: &#39;任务本身的固有复杂性&#39;&#10;    example: &#39;理解业务领域逻辑&#39;&#10;    platform_action: &#39;无法降低，这是有价值的认知负荷&#39;&#10;&#10;  extraneous:&#10;    definition: &#39;环境和工具带来的额外复杂性&#39;&#10;    example: &#39;学习 Kubernetes YAML 语法、调试 CI 配置&#39;&#10;    platform_action: &#39;平台工程的核心消除目标&#39;&#10;&#10;  germane:&#10;    definition: &#39;学习和成长相关的认知投入&#39;&#10;    example: &#39;理解分布式系统原理&#39;&#10;    platform_action: &#39;通过赋能和文档促进，不应阻止&#39;&#10;&#10;cognitive_load_budget:&#10;  principle: &#39;每个团队的认知负荷有上限&#39;&#10;  guidance:&#10;    - &#39;一个团队最多负责 2-3 个领域的认知负荷&#39;&#10;    - &#39;超出预算时，拆分团队或增加平台支撑&#39;&#10;    - &#39;定期评估团队认知负荷（问卷 + 观察）&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cognitive_load_types</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  intrinsic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    definition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'任务本身的固有复杂性'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    example</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'理解业务领域逻辑'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    platform_action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'无法降低，这是有价值的认知负荷'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  extraneous</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    definition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'环境和工具带来的额外复杂性'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    example</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'学习 Kubernetes YAML 语法、调试 CI 配置'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    platform_action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'平台工程的核心消除目标'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  germane</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    definition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'学习和成长相关的认知投入'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    example</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'理解分布式系统原理'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    platform_action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'通过赋能和文档促进，不应阻止'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cognitive_load_budget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  principle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'每个团队的认知负荷有上限'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  guidance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'一个团队最多负责 2-3 个领域的认知负荷'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'超出预算时，拆分团队或增加平台支撑'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'定期评估团队认知负荷（问卷 + 观察）'</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CognitiveLoadAssessment {&#10;  survey_questions: [&#10;    &#39;完成日常工作需要切换多少个工具？&#39;,&#10;    &#39;是否需要理解 Kubernetes 内部机制才能部署？&#39;,&#10;    &#39;新团队成员多久能独立完成首次部署？&#39;,&#10;    &#39;本周有多少时间花在非业务相关的基础设施工作上？&#39;,&#10;  ];&#10;  scoring: {&#10;    low: &#39;0-3 分：认知负荷在可控范围&#39;;&#10;    medium: &#39;4-6 分：需要关注，可优化&#39;;&#10;    high: &#39;7-10 分：认知过载，需要平台介入&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CognitiveLoadAssessment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  survey_questions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '完成日常工作需要切换多少个工具？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '是否需要理解 Kubernetes 内部机制才能部署？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '新团队成员多久能独立完成首次部署？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '本周有多少时间花在非业务相关的基础设施工作上？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scoring</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    low</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0-3 分：认知负荷在可控范围'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    medium</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '4-6 分：需要关注，可优化'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    high</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '7-10 分：认知过载，需要平台介入'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>平台团队应该定期评估各团队的认知负荷状况，将高负荷区域作为平台能力建设的优先方向。这形成了一个持续改进的循环：度量认知负荷 → 识别痛点 → 建设平台能力 → 验证改善效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((平台团队拓扑))&#10;    Team Topologies&#10;      四种团队类型&#10;      三种交互模式&#10;      认知负荷管理&#10;    平台团队定位&#10;      产品团队而非运维&#10;      自助优先&#10;      职责边界清晰&#10;    交互模式演进&#10;      协作→服务化&#10;      辅导→自助&#10;    团队规模&#10;      8-10团队配1平台团队&#10;      按能力域拆分&#10;      含产品经理角色\">mindmap\n  root((平台团队拓扑))\n    Team Topologies\n      四种团队类型\n      三种交互模式\n      认知负荷管理\n    平台团队定位\n      产品团队而非运维\n      自助优先\n      职责边界清晰\n    交互模式演进\n      协作→服务化\n      辅导→自助\n    团队规模\n      8-10团队配1平台团队\n      按能力域拆分\n      含产品经理角色</pre><ul>\n<li>Team Topologies 定义四种团队类型，平台团队的核心使命是降低流对齐团队的认知负荷</li>\n<li>平台团队是产品团队而非运维团队，开发者是用户而非客户</li>\n<li>三种交互模式（协作、服务化、辅导）适用于不同阶段，目标是让大部分能力达到 X-as-a-Service</li>\n<li>团队规模经验法则：每 8-10 个流对齐团队配 1 个平台团队（5-8 人）</li>\n<li>认知负荷分三类：固有的（保留）、外在的（消除）、有益的（促进）</li>\n<li>持续评估认知负荷是平台团队优先级排序的核心依据</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"平台团队拓扑","id":"平台团队拓扑"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"平台团队的定位与职责","id":"平台团队的定位与职责"},{"level":2,"text":"三种团队交互模式","id":"三种团队交互模式"},{"level":2,"text":"平台团队组成与规模","id":"平台团队组成与规模"},{"level":2,"text":"组织演进与认知负荷管理","id":"组织演进与认知负荷管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"开发者体验度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-foundations/developer-experience-metrics"},"next":{"title":"黄金路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/self-service-infrastructure/golden-paths"}}